<%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>

<main class="minor-page our-story-page">
    
    <div class="minor-page-container">

        <div class="minor-page-header">
            <span class="minor-page-eyebrow">OUR STORY</span>
            <h1 class="minor-page-title">It started with a love for the little things.</h1>
            <p class="minor-page-intro">The first bite of a warm pastry. The smell of something freshly baked. A cake brought to the 
                table when everyone gathers around. Crumbelle was created for moments like these.
            </p>
        </div>


        <section class="minor-page-section story-opening-section">

            <div class="story-opening-grid">
                <div class="story-opening-number">
                    <span>01</span>
                    <small>THE BEGINNING</small>
                </div>
                <div class="story-opening-content">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">WHERE IT BEGAN</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">We wanted to make everyday moments feel a little more special.</h2>
                    <p class="minor-page-text">Crumbelle grew from a simple appreciation for the comfort and joy that good baking can 
                        bring. We loved the way a freshly baked treat could change the feeling of an ordinary morning, make an afternoon 
                        pause more enjoyable, or become part of a celebration people remember for years.
                    </p>
                    <p class="minor-page-text">That idea became the heart of Crumbelle: creating beautiful, delicious bakes that have 
                        a place in both life's quiet moments and its biggest occasions.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section story-idea-section">

            <div class="story-idea-content">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">THE IDEA</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Baking is about more than what comes out of the oven.</h2>
                <p class="minor-page-text">A bakery can fill a room with the smell of freshly baked bread, but what stays with us is 
                    often everything that happens around it.
                </p>
                <p class="minor-page-text">The conversation over coffee. The box opened at a gathering. Someone saving the last cookie. 
                    A birthday cake surrounded by candles. A small treat picked up simply because someone deserves one.
                </p>
                <p class="minor-page-text">Those moments are what inspired the Crumbelle philosophy. We don't just want our bakes to 
                    taste good. We want them to become part of something worth remembering.
                </p>
            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section">

            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">THE CRUMBELLE JOURNEY</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">From simple ideas to something worth sharing.</h2>
                <p class="minor-page-section-intro">The Crumbelle story is shaped by a few things that have always mattered to us: 
                    thoughtful baking, beautiful presentation, and the simple happiness that comes from sharing something delicious.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="story-timeline">

                <article class="story-timeline-item">
                    <div class="story-timeline-marker">
                        <span>01</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="story-timeline-content">
                        <span class="story-timeline-label">THE IDEA</span>
                        <h3>Start with the feeling.</h3>
                        <p>Before recipes and collections, there was a simple thought: baking should make people feel something.
                            Comfort, excitement, warmth, anticipation — sometimes all at once.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="story-timeline-item">
                    <div class="story-timeline-marker">
                        <span>02</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="story-timeline-content">
                        <span class="story-timeline-label">THE BAKE</span>
                        <h3>Keep the craft at the centre.</h3>
                        <p>From breads and pastries to cookies and celebration cakes, every category begins with the same belief:
                            good ingredients and careful preparation make a difference.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="story-timeline-item">
                    <div class="story-timeline-marker">
                        <span>03</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="story-timeline-content">
                        <span class="story-timeline-label">THE DETAIL</span>
                        <h3>Make the little things matter.</h3>
                        <p>Texture, flavour, finishing touches, presentation — the smallest details can turn an ordinary treat
                            into something that feels thoughtfully made.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="story-timeline-item">
                    <div class="story-timeline-marker">
                        <span>04</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="story-timeline-content">
                        <span class="story-timeline-label">THE MOMENT</span>
                        <h3>Let the bake become part of the memory.</h3>
                        <p>Ultimately, the best part is not the box leaving the bakery. It is what happens after it arrives —
                            when people gather, share, celebrate, or simply enjoy something good together.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section story-belief-section">

            <div class="story-belief-grid">

                <div class="story-belief-heading">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">WHAT WE BELIEVE</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">The reason behind the bake.</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="story-belief-list">
                
                    <div class="story-belief-item">
                        <span class="story-belief-number">01</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Simple things can be special.</h3>
                            <p>A warm cookie, a flaky pastry, or a slice of cake doesn't need a big occasion to deserve your attention.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="story-belief-item">
                        <span class="story-belief-number">02</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Details make the difference.</h3>
                            <p>The quality of an experience often comes down to the things that are easiest to overlook.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="story-belief-item">
                        <span class="story-belief-number">03</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Food brings people together.</h3>
                            <p>Some of life's best conversations, celebrations, and memories happen around something delicious.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-closing">
            <span class="minor-page-closing-eyebrow">THE CRUMBELLE PHILOSOPHY</span>
            <h2>Bake something beautiful. Make a moment of it.</h2>
            <p>That's the idea behind Crumbelle — and it's the idea we bring to every bake we make.</p>
            <a href="/shop" class="minor-page-primary-button">
                Explore Our Bakes
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
        </section>

    </div>

</main>

<%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>